OL,3,GNEWSAFive murder arrests after man
OL,4,Afound dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a man was
OL,8,Ffound dead.
OL,10,FA man in his 40s was found unresponsive
OL,11,Fin a property on Great Clowes Street in
OL,12,Fthe Broughton area of Salford at about
OL,13,F19:50 BST on Tuesday, Greater
OL,14,FManchester said.
OL,16,FThe man was pronounced dead shortly
OL,17,Fafterwards. Detectives are urging
OL,18,Fanyone with information to contact
OL,19,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
